[heading]Version 0.6.11[/heading]

[list]
[*]Improved traveling while you have NPC companions (the SCore / XNPCCore system used by overhauls like The Wasteland). Teleporting no longer duplicates your companions, and they are now gathered neatly around you on solid ground when you arrive instead of being left buried in the floor or stuck in walls. Only your own companions that came along are moved, and nothing changes on setups without companions.
[*]No save reset required.
[/list]
